# SMAX Backend - Commercial Vehicle Marketplace API

## 📋 Project Overview

Node.js/Express backend API for SMAX marketplace platform. Supports user authentication, vehicle listings, real-time chat, video/voice calls, push notifications, and service center directory.

**Total APIs:** 73 endpoints
**Status:** Production Ready

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Versions

### **Runtime & Package Manager**
```
Node.js: v22.18.0 (or v18+ recommended)
npm: v10.x (comes with Node.js)
```

### **Core Framework**
```json
{
  "express": "^4.18.2",
  "mongoose": "^8.0.0"
}
```

### **Database**
```
MongoDB: v6.0+ (Local or Atlas)
```

### **Key Dependencies**

| Package | Purpose | Version |
|---------|---------|---------|
| express | Web framework | ^4.18.2 |
| mongoose | MongoDB ODM | ^8.0.0 |
| jsonwebtoken | JWT authentication | ^9.0.0 |
| bcryptjs | Password hashing | ^2.4.3 |
| cloudinary | Image/video storage | ^1.41.0 |
| twilio | SMS OTP service | ^4.19.0 |
| nodemailer | Email service | ^6.9.7 |
| firebase-admin | Push notifications | ^11.11.0 |
| agora-access-token | Video/voice calls | ^2.0.4 |
| multer | File upload handling | ^1.4.5 |
| cors | CORS handling | ^2.8.5 |
| dotenv | Environment variables | ^16.3.1 |

### **Development Dependencies**

| Package | Purpose | Version |
|---------|---------|---------|
